# Mentorix Backend

**Monolith** Go REST (Echo) + PostgreSQL (`mentorix`) + Redis. One `user_id` for all login channels. No microservices/gRPC without explicit request.

## Go-first design

Prefer idiomatic Go: bounded parallelism, worker pools for independent I/O, `context` cancellation. Details: [go-code.mdc](go-code.mdc).

## Before non-trivial work

1. [docs/status.md](../../docs/status.md) — what exists
2. [docs/features/<feature>.md](../../docs/features/) — feature you touch
3. [docs-and-rules-maintenance.mdc](docs-and-rules-maintenance.mdc) — how to update docs/rules

