## Git

Branches: `feature/`, `bugfix/`, `hotfix/`, `chore/`, `docs/`, `refactor/`, `test/` + kebab-case. Commits: Conventional Commits (`feat`, `fix`, …). `feat` only for user-facing behavior.

Compare 2–3 library options before adding deps; record significant choices in [docs/architecture.md](../../docs/architecture.md).
